    "Bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Dostupno s cloud ra\u010dunom", // EN: Available with a cloud account
    "\u00d6nce bulut hesab\u0131nla giri\u015f yap.": "Prvo se prijavite sa svojim cloud ra\u010dunom.", // EN: Sign in with your cloud account first.
    "Durum al\u0131namad\u0131": "Nije uspjelo u\u010ditavanje statusa", // EN: Couldn't load the status
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131 kodu a\u00e7\u0131k": "Kod autentifikatora je uklju\u010den", // EN: Authenticator code is on
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r.": "Dvofaktorska provjera zahtijeva cloud ra\u010dun.", // EN: Two-step verification needs a cloud account.
    "Kapatmak i\u00e7in kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki kodu gir.": "Unesite kod autentifikatora da ga isklju\u010dite.", // EN: Enter the authenticator code to turn it off.
    "Kodu kimlik uygulamas\u0131na okut, sonra uygulamadaki 6 haneyi gir.": "Skenirajte kod s va\u0161om aplikacijom autentifikatora, zatim unesite 6 znamenki.", // EN: Scan the code with your authenticator app, then enter the 6 digits.
    "Kurulum kodu": "Kod za postavljanje", // EN: Setup code
    "Kodu okutam\u0131yorsan bu anahtar\u0131 uygulamaya yaz:": "Ako ne mo\u017eete skenirati, unesite ovaj klju\u010d u aplikaciju:", // EN: If you can't scan it, type this key into the app:
    "Kod 6 hane olmal\u0131.": "Kod mora imati 6 znamenki.", // EN: The code must be 6 digits.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti.": "Kod je pogre\u0161an ili je istekao.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti. Telefonunun saati otomatik ayarl\u0131 de\u011filse kodlar tutmaz; saati otomati\u011fe al\u0131p yenilenen kodu bir kez dene.": "Kod je pogre\u0161an ili je istekao. Kodovi se ne podudaraju ako je sat na va\u0161em telefonu postavljen ru\u010dno; prebacite ga na automatsko i poku\u0161ajte s a\u017euriranim kodom.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired. Codes do not match if your phone's clock is not set automatically; switch it to automatic and try the refreshed code once.
    "Kod do\u011frulanamad\u0131.": "Kod nije mogu\u0107e potvrditi.", // EN: The code could not be verified.
    "\u0130\u015flem tamamlanamad\u0131.": "Akcija nije mogla biti dovr\u0161ena.", // EN: The action could not be completed.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Dvostupanjska provjera je uklju\u010dena.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Dvostupanjska provjera je isklju\u010dena.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Unesite 6-znamenkasti kod iz va\u0161e aplikacije za autentifikaciju.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "Otvorite aplikaciju za autentifikaciju poput Google Authenticator ili Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "Skenirajte k\u00f4d ispod ili unesite klju\u010d ru\u010dno.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "Unesite 6-znamenkasti kod iz aplikacije i dodirnite Potvrdi.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Izbri\u0161ite sve stare NEXUS unose u aplikaciji; svaka konfiguracija stvara novi klju\u010d, i samo je kod onoga kojeg ste posljednjeg skenirali va\u017ee\u0107i.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "Napredne veze: dodajte Home Assistant ure\u0111aje", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije mogu\u0107e povezati se s ure\u0111ajem. Provjerite je li na istoj mre\u017ei i jesu li ID ure\u0111aja i lokalni klju\u010d ispravni.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije mogu\u0107e povezati se s posrednikom. Provjerite jesu li korisni\u010dko ime i lozinka ispravni.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
    "Ev A\u011f\u0131": "Ku\u0107na mre\u017ea", // EN: Home Network
