    "Uzak eri\u015fim adresi": "Adresa za daljinski pristup", // EN: Remote access address
    "Sipari\u015flerim": "Moje narud\u017ebe", // EN: My Orders
    "\u00d6deme ge\u00e7mi\u015fi (Sipari\u015flerim)": "Povijest pla\u0107anja (Moje narud\u017ebe)", // EN: Payment history (My Orders)
    "Faturaland\u0131rmay\u0131 y\u00f6net": "Upravljajte naplatom", // EN: Manage billing
    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Problem s narud\u017ebom? Po\u0161aljite povratnu informaciju", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Spremne stavke sada rade; stavke koje nisu spremne ozna\u010dene su kao \"Dolazi uskoro\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Podr\u0161ka za Apple Watch uskoro", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS jo\u0161 ne uklju\u010duje aplikaciju za Apple Watch. Kada bude objavljena, mo\u0107i \u0107ete pokretati scenarije i vidjeti kriti\u010dne obavijesti direktno s va\u0161eg zape\u0161\u0107a.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "\u0160to mo\u017eete u\u010diniti danas", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Dr\u017eite obavijesti uklju\u010dene za kriti\u010dne doga\u0111aje; obavijesti se odmah prikazuju na va\u0161em telefonu.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Ho\u0107e li se ove obavijesti prikazivati na va\u0161em satu ovisi o postavkama Watcha na va\u0161em iPhoneu; NEXUS ne \u0161alje ni\u0161ta posebno na sat.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Otvorite postavke obavijesti", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kopirajte klju\u010d", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Otvorite u aplikaciji za autentifikaciju", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Ako izgubite pristup svojoj aplikaciji za autentifikaciju, ne\u0107ete se mo\u0107i prijaviti jer je kod potreban prilikom prijave. Spremite ovaj klju\u010d na sigurno mjesto.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Klju\u010d kopiran \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Nije moglo kopirati; upi\u0161ite klju\u010d ru\u010dno.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
    "6 haneli kod": "6-znamenkasti kod", // EN: 6-digit code
    "Do\u011frula": "Potvrdi", // EN: Verify
    "Yak\u0131nda": "Dolazi uskoro", // EN: Coming soon
    "Hesab\u0131m": "Moj ra\u010dun", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Izbri\u0161i moj ra\u010dun", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Va\u0161 ra\u010dun, profil i sinkronizirani podaci trajno su izbrisani. Ako imate aktivnu NEXUS+ pretplatu, najprije je otka\u017eite u Naplati. Ovo se ne mo\u017ee poni\u0161titi.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Jeste li sigurni? Ponovno dodirnite za brisanje", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Bri\u0161em\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Ra\u010dun izbrisan. Ne zaboravite otkazati pretplatu na svom Whop ra\u010dunu.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Va\u0161 ra\u010dun i podaci su izbrisani.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Za uklanjanje NEXUS podataka s ovog ure\u0111aja, dovoljno je Postavke \u2192 Odjava; nema cloud ra\u010duna.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Brisanje ra\u010duna na strani poslu\u017eitelja jo\u0161 nije implementirano. Za sada se mo\u017eete odjaviti.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Uklju\u010dio sam Ne ometaj; nikakva obavje\u0161tenja vas ne\u0107e ometati. [AKCIJA: UKLJU\u010cI_NOMETAJ]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "Scenarij se za sada mo\u017ee pokrenuti jednim dodirom s kartice Tap to Run na po\u010detnom zaslonu. Nakon \u0161to NEXUS bude na App Store-u, mo\u0107i \u0107ete ga dodati Siri direktno s ovog zaslona.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
