    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "\u010cavrljajte i s ra\u010dunala; va\u0161e konverzacije ostaju sinkronizirane na svim va\u0161im ure\u0111ajima.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Pridru\u017ei se Domu", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kad se ure\u0111aj uklju\u010di ili isklju\u010di", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Dodirnite ure\u0111aj da biste otvorili kontrolni zaslon panela; prikazuje samo zna\u010dajke koje taj ure\u0111aj podr\u017eava. Za Shelly, WLED i ESPHome ure\u0111aje, uklju\u010divanje/isklju\u010divanje i svjetlina idu izravno na ure\u0111aj.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ovaj se kod koristi na zaslonu Pridru\u017ei se domu.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "Dovoljno je jedan dodir", // EN: One tap is all it takes
