    "Br\u00fcksel": "Bruxelles", // EN: Brussels
    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj 8-znamenkasti kod je za uparivanje s Apple HomeKit i radi samo s aplikacijom Apple Home. Ako ure\u0111aj podr\u017eava lokalni API kao \u0161to je Shelly, WLED ili Tasmota, mo\u017eete ga dodati preko lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj QR kod pripada Wi-Fi mre\u017ei, a ne ure\u0111aju. Nakon povezivanja ure\u0111aja na istu mre\u017eu, mo\u017eete ga dodati s va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nema poznatog NEXUS ure\u0111aja prona\u0111enog na ovoj adresi. Provjerite je li ure\u0111aj uklju\u010den i na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Kreirajte ovu pametnu aplikaciju:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Priprema predlo\u017eenih zna\u010dajki za ovaj tijek.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Sa\u010duvano ovog mjeseca", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Na ovoj mre\u017ei nije prona\u0111en podr\u017eani ure\u0111aj.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Na ovoj mre\u017ei nije prona\u0111en podr\u017eani ure\u0111aj. Provjerite je li ure\u0111aj uklju\u010den i povezan na isti Wi-Fi; u suprotnom, koristite katalog ispod ili QR / kod za postavljanje.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lokalna za\u0161tita za ovaj ure\u0111aj", // EN: Local protection for this device
