    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj ili veza ne podr\u017eava svjetiljku.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj ne podr\u017eava automatsku lokaciju.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Ovaj pozivni kod nije prona\u0111en.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ovaj zaslon grupira rasvjetna tijela koja ste dodali po sobama; kada spremite scenu, svjetlina i ton se postavljaju zajedno.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Ure\u0111aji koje dodate u ovaj dom navedeni su ovdje.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Ure\u0111aji koje dodate u ovaj dom navedeni su ovdje i povezani su s va\u0161im omiljenim karticama.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Jeste li sigurni da \u017eelite trajno obrisati ovaj dom i sve njegove postavke?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj kod nije podr\u017eani kod ure\u0111aja. Ako znate IP adresu ure\u0111aja, mo\u017eete ga dodati s va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Ove marke se kontroliraju putem va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Ovu mini aplikaciju pru\u017ea slu\u017ebeni dobavlja\u010d.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Ovo okru\u017eenje ne podr\u017eava pristup kameri.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Skeniranje mre\u017ee ovdje nije dostupno.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Nema sigurne enkripcije u ovom okru\u017eenju.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Kada se ovaj scenarij pokrene, povezani ure\u0111aji se automatski pode\u0161avaju.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Ni jedan ure\u0111aj nije pogo\u0111en ovim scenarijem \u2014 najprije dodajte odgovaraju\u0107i ure\u0111aj.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Morate dodati kompatibilan ure\u0111aj da biste koristili ovaj scenarij.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Ovo je va\u0161 jedini dom. Ako ga izbri\u0161ete, ponovno \u0107e se stvoriti prazan \"Moj dom\". Nastaviti?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
