    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Nisam uspio rije\u0161iti u potpunosti. Po\u0161aljite povratne informacije na\u0161em timu putem donjeg obrasca i javit \u0107emo vam se \u010dim budemo mogli, ili nastavite s \"Otvori cijeli chat\".", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
