    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Isklju\u010di sve grupe rasvjete uklju\u010dene u domu.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
