    "Evde yokken": "Kad ste odsutni", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Upravljajte svjetlima u svom domu po sobama u jednom tijeku. Uklju\u010divanje/isklju\u010divanje, svjetlina, temperatura boje i kratice za brze scene u jednoj aplikaciji.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Dajte spremne naredbe, brze automatizacije i pametne prijedloge aplikacija na temelju ure\u0111aja kod ku\u0107e.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Stvorite aplikaciju za klimatizaciju koja upravlja klima ure\u0111ajima i termostatima u va\u0161em domu s jednog panela. Uklju\u010dite kontrolu temperature, brze na\u010dine rada, eko na\u010din rada i radnje temeljene na sobi.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Koje je stanje mojih ure\u0111aja?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Izvan ku\u0107e", // EN: Away from Home
