    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Odlazak iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Provjera prije izlaska iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Scena 'Odlazak iz ku\u0107e'", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Sa\u017eetak odlaska iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Zavr\u0161etak odlaska iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Stvorite aplikaciju za provjeru prije izlaska iz ku\u0107e koja prikazuje ure\u0111aje koji su ostali uklju\u010deni, status zaklju\u010davanja i postavke energije na jednom ekranu. Dodajte tipke za brzo isklju\u010divanje i aktivaciju sigurnosti.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Provjerite ure\u0111aje koji su ostali uklju\u010deni, zaklju\u010davanja i status energije u jednom tijeku prilikom izlaska iz ku\u0107e.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Prika\u017ei ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, zaklju\u010davanja i status energije na jednom zaslonu pri izlasku iz ku\u0107e.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Pogledajte svjetla, utika\u010de, klima ure\u0111aje i sigurnosne postavke koje su uklju\u010dene prije izlaska iz ku\u0107e, na jednoj plo\u010di. Sakupite brze korake isklju\u010divanja i aktiviranja sigurnosti u jedan tijek.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Obavimo kona\u010dne provjere prije nego \u0161to iza\u0111ete.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Isklju\u010dite svjetla automatski nakon izlaska...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Isklju\u010dite svjetla automatski nakon izlaska iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Isklju\u010dite svjetla automatski nakon \u0161to iza\u0111ete i uklju\u010dite ih kada se vratite.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Isklju\u010dite klima ure\u0111aj automatski kada nema nikoga kod ku\u0107e i izbjegnite nepotro\u0161nju energije.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Automatski isklju\u010dite ure\u0111aje u stanju pripravnosti u vrijeme koje odaberete no\u0107u.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
