    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 veya ge\u00e7ici eri\u015fim bilgisi olmadan haz\u0131r durum g\u00f6stermiyoruz.": "Ne prikazujemo status spremnosti bez gostinjske mre\u017ee ili podataka za privremeni pristup.", // EN: We don't show a ready state without guest network or temporary access details.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Kreirajte aplikaciju za na\u010din rada gostiju koja priprema ulaz, rasvjetu i ure\u0111aje u zajedni\u010dkim prostorijama \u010dim gosti stignu. Uklju\u010dite svjetlo dobrodo\u0161lice, tihe obavijesti i korake za pristup gostiju.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda kullan\u0131lacak \u0131\u015f\u0131k, eri\u015fim ve ortam ayarlar\u0131.": "Postavke svjetla, pristupa i atmosfere za kori\u0161tenje \u010dim gosti stignu.", // EN: Light, access and ambience settings to use as soon as guests arrive.
    "Misafir gelmeden \u00f6nce giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma, ortak alan ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde haz\u0131rla. Ev i\u00e7inde rahat ama g\u00fcvenli bir kar\u015f\u0131lama ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Pripremite ulaz, osvjetljenje, zajedni\u010dke prostore i ure\u0111aje za zabavu na jednom panelu prije dolaska gostiju. Kreirajte opu\u0161teni, ali sigurni tok dobrodo\u0161lice kod ku\u0107e.", // EN: Prepare the entrance, lighting, shared areas and entertainment devices on one panel before guests arrive. Create a relaxed but secure welcome flow at home.
