    "NEXUS Y\u00f6nlendiriliyor...": "Mo\u017eete se pridru\u017eiti uno\u0161enjem ovog koda u \"Pridru\u017ei se domu\" unutar NEXUS-a.", // EN: Redirecting to NEXUS...
    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Pokrenite svoje NEXUS scenarije glasom sa Siri u samo nekoliko sekundi.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "NEXUS je lokalno-prioritetan: podaci va\u0161eg ure\u0111aja ostaju na ovom ure\u0111aju, naredbe ure\u0111aja idu izravno preko va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee i ni\u0161ta se ne dijeli s tre\u0107im stranama.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS \u00b7 Prijava", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
