    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Pove\u017eite NEXUS s drugim platformama kako biste kontrolirali svoje ure\u0111aje s bilo kojeg mjesta.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Ove veze servisa jo\u0161 nisu dostupne. Za ure\u0111aje tre\u0107ih strana, mo\u017eete koristiti Home Assistant iz Integracija.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
