    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Na ovoj adresi postoji ure\u0111aj, ali ne koristi NEXUS protokol.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj je ve\u0107 dodan.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Upari i dodaj", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Kod za uparivanje nije valjan. Unesite 11-znamenkasti kod ili QR sadr\u017eaj koji po\u010dinje s MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Unesite ovaj kod u NEXUS desktop aplikaciju. Ako je ure\u0111aj na Wi-Fi mre\u017ei, tako\u0111er ga mo\u017eete dodati s lokalne mre\u017ee pomo\u0107u njegove IP adrese.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Ure\u0111aj se tra\u017ei na istoj mre\u017ei i uparuje. To mo\u017ee potrajati do minute; ure\u0111aj mora biti uklju\u010den i u na\u010dinu uparivanja.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en ili se nije mogao povezati. Provjerite je li na istoj mre\u017ei, uklju\u010den i u na\u010dinu za uparivanje.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en. Provjerite je li na istoj mre\u017ei, uklju\u010den i u na\u010dinu za uparivanje. Vatrozid va\u0161eg ra\u010dunala mo\u017ee blokirati odgovore s ure\u0111aja na lokalnoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Ure\u0111aj se nije mogao povezati. Provjerite kod za uparivanje i je li ure\u0111aj u na\u010dinu za uparivanje.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Ure\u0111aj je povezan, ali nema funkciju kojom NEXUS mo\u017ee upravljati.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ure\u0111aj nije odgovorio. Provjerite je li uklju\u010den i na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
