    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TV, zvu\u010dnici i zabavni ure\u0111aji", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Spoji TV, medijski ure\u0111aj i ambijentalna svjetla u jednu radnju. Olak\u0161aj postavljanje pokretanja filma, no\u0107nog na\u010dina i scena zabave bez ometanja.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Naravno! Mogu sastaviti sjajan pametan scenarij za tebe. Mo\u017ee\u0161 li mi dati nekoliko detalja? Na primjer: \"Pokreni aparat za kavu kada se probudim\" ili \"Potpuno prigu\u0161i svjetla kada gledam film\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
