    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Automatsko upravljanje ventilacijom i pro\u010di\u0161\u0107iva\u010dima na temelju podataka senzora.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken sessizlik, do\u011fru \u0131\u015f\u0131k ve bildirim aras\u0131.": "Tihi, pravilno osvijetljeni prostor i bez prekida dok radite.", // EN: Quiet, proper lighting and no interruptions while you work.
