    "Yapay zeka ile evinizi ak\u0131ll\u0131ca y\u00f6netin, enerjiden tasarruf edin ve konforunuzu art\u0131r\u0131n.": "Pametno upravljajte svojim domom pomo\u0107u AI, \u0161tedite energiju i pove\u0107ajte udobnost.", // EN: Manage your home smartly with AI, save energy and increase your comfort.
