    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kada se vrata ili prozor otvore", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kada se senzor vrata/prozora otvori", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kada senzor dima, poplave ili plina ispusti alarm", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Okida\u010di ure\u0111aja i senzora prikazuju se ovdje nakon \u0161to dodate odgovaraju\u0107i ure\u0111aj.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Dom i okolina", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Kada temperatura, vjetar ili ki\u0161a prije\u0111u prag", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
    "T\u00fcm \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7": "Uklju\u010di sva svjetla", // EN: Turn on all lights
    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Ve\u010dera", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Otvorite zavjese", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Zaklju\u010dajte vrata", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Uklju\u010duje svako svjetlo na punu svjetlinu.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Isklju\u010duje sva svjetla.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Uklju\u010duje svjetla na punu svjetlinu u dnevnom tonu.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Postavlja svjetla na 85% u neutralnom tonu i isklju\u010duje TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Postavlja svjetla na 40% u toplom tonu.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Svake ve\u010deri u 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Uklju\u010duje klima ure\u0111aj na 20\u00b0 i postavlja termostat na 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Postavlja termostat na udobnu postavku od 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Radnim danima u 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Otvara sve zavjese i rolete.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Svaki dan u izlazak sunca", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Zatvara sve zavjese i rolete.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Svaki dan u zalazak sunca", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Zaklju\u010dava svaka pametna vrata (vrata se nikada ne otklju\u010davaju).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Isklju\u010duje svjetla i televizor; ostavlja uti\u010dnice i klima ure\u0111aj uklju\u010dene.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Uklju\u010di ili isklju\u010di ure\u0111aj", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "\u0160alje naredbu jednom ure\u0111aju koji odaberete.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Koji ure\u0111aj?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Uklju\u010di", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Isklju\u010di", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Odaberite ure\u0111aj koji \u017eelite kontrolirati.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Pogledajte kvalitetu zraka, temperaturu i vlagu koju mjere va\u0161i senzori te upravljajte svojim pro\u010dista\u010dem.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Pripremite svjetla, zavjese i klima ure\u0111aj za dan jednim dodirom.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Uklju\u010dite svjetla, zavjese i klimatizaciju zajedno kad do\u0111ete ku\u0107i.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Stavite svoje ure\u0111aje u sigurno, \u0161tedljivo stanje dok ste odsutni du\u017ee vrijeme.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Prigu\u0161i svjetla, zatvori zavjese i upali televizor.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Pokreni svoj robotski usisava\u010d ili ga po\u0161alji natrag na postolje.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Zaklju\u010daj vrata, zatvori zavjese i pripremi ku\u0107u za no\u0107.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Pogledaj status i postavke privatnosti svojih kamera na jednom zaslonu.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Uklju\u010di ili isklju\u010di na\u010din privatnosti za svoje kamere s jednog mjesta dok si kod ku\u0107e.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Pogledaj koja automatizacija se pokre\u0107e danas.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Dijeli bilje\u0161ke i zadatke sa svojom ku\u0107anstvom.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Pogledaj sa\u017eetak zdravstvenog stanja ku\u0107e na temelju zraka, vlage i temperature koje mjere tvoji senzori.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Provjeri mogu li se tvoji ure\u0111aji dohvatiti preko lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
    "Yeni bir otomasyon olu\u015fturmak istiyorum.": "\u017delim stvoriti novu automatizaciju.", // EN: I want to create a new automation.
    "Yeni bir t\u0131kla ve \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r senaryosu olu\u015fturmak istiyorum.": "\u017delim stvoriti novi scenarij dodirni-i-pokreni.", // EN: I want to create a new tap-to-run scenario.
