    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Pozivnica je kreirana, ali automatski email nije mogao biti poslan. \u017delite li pripremiti tekst pozivnice putem va\u0161e mail aplikacije?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
