    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Uklju\u010duje svjetla i otvara zavjese, pokre\u0107e klima ure\u0111aj na 22\u00b0 i \u0161alje usisava\u010d na punjenje.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
